# Cloudflare Pages / Workers static-assets header rules.
#
# The site is currently served with:
#     permissions-policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
# `microphone=()` disables the microphone for the WHOLE document and overrides
# the browser's site permission, which breaks voice mode (live speech and
# recording alike).
#
# This file overrides that header and re-enables the mic for the site itself.
# Rules in `_headers` take precedence over what Cloudflare sends by default.

/*
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(self), geolocation=()

# If you would rather drop the header completely instead of restricting it,
# replace the line above with a detach rule (the "! " prefix removes a header):
#
# /*
#   ! Permissions-Policy
